# Shambler (R3, the Dead): hunched, head low and forward, arms hanging ahead, one leg short (a limp).
# Its one light cue: two dim rot-green eyes. The Brute row wears it at a bigger scale.
name shambler
grid 5
size 18 14 34
slot body Flesh
slot rag InkBrown
slot eye Rot
box 6 3 0 9 6 15 rag
box 6 8 0 9 11 13 rag
box 5 3 14 11 11 22 rag
box 8 3 21 14 11 27 body
box 12 5 24 17 9 30 body
box 16 4 27 17 6 29 eye
box 16 8 27 17 10 29 eye
beam 11 2 26 17 1 16 1.2 body
beam 11 12 26 16 13 18 1.2 body
noise 0.15 7 rag
pivot 8 7 0
# R20 animation segments: the short right leg limps, both arms hang forward from the shoulders, the head lolls.
part LegL 0 0 0 18 7 14 7.5 4.5 14
part LegR 0 7 0 18 14 14 7.5 9.5 13
part ArmL 9 0 15 18 3 28 11 2 26
part ArmR 9 11 15 18 14 28 11 12 26
part Head 14 4 24 18 10 30 13 7 26
part Head 12 4 27 14 10 30 13 7 26
